{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段片長約 19 秒的影片，顯示屯門一地盤懷疑發生高空擲物事件。事發於晚上時份，懷疑有工人在大廈高層位置，將多件地盤物料及雜物高空扔下，期間發出一聲聲巨響。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-18-11h46m26s588.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026SYIQEpw5Fo1787025693.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-18-11h46m26s588.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片雖然未有交代確切拍攝日期、時間及確實位置，但有網民從現場環境及建築物外貌推測，事發地點懷疑是屯門清田邨附近一個簡約公屋地盤。片中可見，有多名疑似工人在不同樓層高空擲物，過程中有超過十件物料被扔下。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-18-11h46m43s653.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Ygls3IM1kR1787025710.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-18-11h46m43s653.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議，不少網民直指相關行為危險兼離譜，紛紛留言質疑：「呢啲係咪叫趁黑『偷雞』搏你影唔到同睇唔到」、「擲到人點算？」，亦有網民留言批評「離晒譜！」</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T07:40:49.012750+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}